  "details": "After the last update, hand tracking is buggy again and interaction is limited:\n\n1. Lock hand controls by pinching pinky and thumb fingers on left hand\n\n2. Open the menu with any of hand gesture methods\n\n3. Try to make any selections on the menu with the left hand\n\nResults: Left hand cannot be used to select items in the menu or interact with the menu. Right hand can still be used for that.\n\nBug does not happen when hand tracking gesture controls are unlocked.\n\nBoth hands should still be able to interact with menu, locking controls should only affect movement and rotation.",
